<p><strong>Old runs</strong></p>



<figure class="wp-block-table"><table><tbody><tr><td>Number:</td><td>NH3 Run #100 !! &#8211; The Schrödinger Hare r*n</td></tr><tr><td>Description:</td><td>Once upon a time, there was a little Hasher in Nuremberg who said &#8222;I want to lay shiggy trail for my running friends&#8220;&#8230; and so a trail was run, and hashers were laid!<br>And the trails kept coming, and the hashers kept debauching&#8230;<br>First came 10, then 50, then 99&#8230;Now we celebrate our #100 trail !!Come and join us on Sept. 12th in Nürnberg to reminisce all the trails you got lost on and to continue looking for the next trail!We hope all NH3 hashers, present and past, will have the chance of joining on the occasion.<br>Our ex-GM KumaYuda will lay a quantum trail, as new little Hashers make his world unpredictable&#8230; So like Schrödingers&#8216; cat, maybe you&#8217;ll see the hare on trail, maybe not&#8230;<br>Be there to find out!OnOn!!</td></tr><tr><td>Hare:</td><td>KumaYuda (maybe?maybe not?) + RainbowWarrior</td></tr><tr><td>Date:</td><td>Saturday 12th September 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Time:</td><td>13:30</td></tr><tr><td>Venue:</td><td>Springbrunnen in the Cramer-Klett-Park (Äußere Cramer-Klett-Straße 8, 90489 Nürnberg)</td></tr><tr><td>How to get there:</td><td>Get to Nürnberg Hbf (train station) then take Tram S8 or Subway U2/U3 until Rathenauplatz. The park is along the main road at the corner (look to hash-markings at the exit of the tram/subway)</td></tr><tr><td>Google Maps:</td><td>https://maps.app.goo.gl/istXVU3T4qzovRiM6</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>



<figure class="wp-block-table"><table><tbody><tr><td>Number:</td><td>NH3 Run #99 &#8211; Ohoh I did a S.H.I.T.S. (away trail in Würzburg)</td></tr><tr><td>Description:</td><td>Trail is moving to the wine country<br>For this collab between SHITS and NH3, we are hashing in Würzburg for some hilly and shiggy trails.<br>Our guest-hare Made2Cum is tasting all the wines of the region to lead you to the best beer that Würzburg has to offer!For those interested, there will be an on-after. Please let us know if you are joining so we can make a reservation</td></tr><tr><td>Hare:</td><td>Made2Cum</td></tr><tr><td>Date:</td><td>Saturday 22th August 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Time:</td><td>13:30</td></tr><tr><td>Venue:</td><td>Würzburg Ludwigkai (Kurt-Schumacher-Promenade, 97072 Würzburg)</td></tr><tr><td>How to get there:</td><td>From the Hauptbahnhof take Tram 4 in the direction of Sanderau. Get off at Arndtstraße and walk 500m.<br>Car park nearby, 0,50€/30min</td></tr><tr><td>Google Maps:</td><td>https://maps.app.goo.gl/8ZdxH9AKT3ygMAn57?g_st=aw</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>



<figure class="wp-block-table"><table><tbody><tr><td>Number:</td><td>NH3 Run #98 &#8211; Ba Ba Black Sheep trail</td></tr><tr><td>Description:</td><td>Trail is back in Nbg, heading out on the Pegnitztal east of the city where sheep usually graze. Will you be the one special sheep?<br>Whether you jump over them or do something else is up to you, as long as you follow trail!<br>On-after will be at the Naturbad Erlenstegen for a nice cool-down after that shiggy trail (pending nice weather)</td></tr><tr><td>Hare:</td><td>RainbowWarrior</td></tr><tr><td>Date:</td><td>Saturday 11th July 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Time:</td><td>13:30</td></tr><tr><td>Venue:</td><td>Nürnberg Erlenstegen</td></tr><tr><td>How to get there:</td><td>Take tram 8 from Nürnberg Hbf (about 15min) or use one of train/S-Bahn stopping at Erlenstegen</td></tr><tr><td>Google Maps:</td><td><a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/eB5BtARcWy8A9N5m6">https://maps.app.goo.gl/eB5BtARcWy8A9N5m6</a></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>



<figure class="wp-block-table"><table><tbody><tr><td>Number:</td><td>NH3 Run #96 &#8211; Darkness Into Light ????➡️☀️</td></tr><tr><td>Description:</td><td>A hash trail with a difference.<br>Join the millions of people across the world getting up out of their beds at silly o&#8217;clock in the morning to do a walk/run and give those suffering with mental health issues hope that there is light at the end of the tunnel and let them know they are not alone! Of course our trail will be better than theirs….cause ours will be a hash trail!<br>https://www.darknessintolight.ie/Please RSVP (on the whatsapp group) as we will also organise breakfast ????<br>(link to WhatsApp: https://chat.whatsapp.com/DbHVGtYmfcRLvzegRh9N97 )</td></tr><tr><td>Hare:</td><td>Put It Elswhere</td></tr><tr><td>Date:</td><td>Saturday 9th May 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Time:</td><td>4am<br>(that&#8217;s not a typo, it&#8217;s really 4 o&#8217;clock in the morning!)<br>If you need crash space for the night before, please contact the hare????</td></tr><tr><td>Venue:</td><td>Haus der Bayerischen Geschichte, Regensburg</td></tr><tr><td>How to get there:</td><td>&#8211;</td></tr><tr><td>Google Maps:</td><td>https://maps.app.goo.gl/Ma6YMDsZoFyja3LPA</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>



<figure class="wp-block-table"><table><tbody><tr><td>Number:</td><td>NH3 Run #95 &#8211; I think I saw a wabbit</td></tr><tr><td>Description:</td><td>Even after Easter, a drunken hare will still be roaming through the city… The hunting season is open!<br>C*m and join for a live trail through Nürnberg, with some hidden surprises for children of all age ????</td></tr><tr><td>Hare:</td><td>Rainbow Warrior</td></tr><tr><td>Date:</td><td>Saturday April 11th 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Time:</td><td>14:00 / 2pm</td></tr><tr><td>Venue:</td><td>Rosenaupark</td></tr><tr><td>How to get there:</td><td>Get off at the metro station &#8222;Plärrer&#8220; oder the tram station &#8222;Obere. Turnstr.&#8220; and walk across to the park</td></tr><tr><td>Google Maps:</td><td>https://maps.app.goo.gl/6ZE7izc78XjpLw6c9</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>



<figure class="wp-block-table"><table><tbody><tr><td>Number:</td><td>NH3 Run #94 &#8211; Just r*n</td></tr><tr><td>Description:</td><td>C*m and join us on trail as JustClaudia takes us into shiggy paths on the outskirt of Nürnberg for her 1st trail as a hare&#8230;!</td></tr><tr><td>Hare:</td><td>Just Claudia</td></tr><tr><td>Date:</td><td>Saturday March 14th 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Time:</td><td>13:00 / 1pm</td></tr><tr><td>Venue:</td><td>Neptunebrunnen (fountain) at the Stadtpark in Nürnberg</td></tr><tr><td>How to get there:</td><td>Get of at the Ubahn Rennweg and follow the markings to go across the Bayreutherstr into the Stadtpark. The fountain is on the opposite side of the pond.<br>Or use technology, you&#8217;re a grown-up!</td></tr><tr><td>Google Maps:</td><td>https://maps.app.goo.gl/hniN5fkL1fkopFv48</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>



<figure class="wp-block-table"><table><tbody><tr><td>Number:</td><td>NH3 Run #93 Fuck Valentine&#8217;s Day</td></tr><tr><td>Description:</td><td>Why: Fuck Valentine&#8217;s Day<br>Who: You<br>1st Nuremberg Hash of 2026 is being hared by Squeeze It. Turn up to escape the heart shaped chocolate.<br>There is an on after in mind, depending on time and temperature of hanging around outside.<br>Bring warm clothes.. edible undies are not required, but not forbidden.</td></tr><tr><td>Hare:</td><td>Squeeze It</td></tr><tr><td>Date:</td><td>Saturday 14th February 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Time:</td><td>13:00</td></tr><tr><td>Venue:</td><td>South Side of Nürnberg HBF at the diamond</td></tr><tr><td>How to get there:</td><td>&#8211;</td></tr><tr><td>Google Maps:</td><td>https://maps.app.goo.gl/bhFyphH7dWkYizU78?g_st=aw</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>



<figure class="wp-block-table"><table><tbody><tr><td>Number:</td><td>NH3 Run #91 Shooting Stars + #92 Bad Santa r*n</td></tr><tr><td>Description:</td><td>Nuremberg H3 is back again with an even colder run! Closer to Christmas! With more miles! and definitely more drinks and Gluhwein!<br>We&#8217;re participating in trifuckta v2 with our sister kennels. Their dates are as follow:<br>December 5th-7th: Frankfurt H3 Hashmas<br>December 12th-14th: Sembach H3 12 DDs<br>Make all 3 and get a special hashy Christmas gift !!!<br>Bad Santa weekend will be €10 (covers drinks on Friday&#8217;s trail , Saturday&#8217;s trail drinks and snacks for circle!), conveniently located near an A&amp;O hostel by the main train station, and start at 1300 hash time.Friday: (Wear your favorite ugly sweater or let me know at the end of this rego if you need one! I&#8217;ve plenty) We&#8217;ll have a Sternschnuppe Trail (shooting star trail) with several shots/drinks (bring your vessel or use the tiny ones we&#8217;ll provide) followed by a Biergarten afterwards! Bring a <em>headlamp</em> and warm clothes, this is a walking trail since we&#8217;re chasing stars!Saturday: (Wear your santa outfit! or Grinch! or elf! or reindeer!) We&#8217;ll run through a Weihnachtsmarkten so bring cash for Glühwein and goodies you might want to purchase! We&#8217;ll have Christmas snacks and liquid goods for your enjoyment before/after trail ???? as well as MM announcement and Trifukta gimmies give away! There will be a bag car for you to drop your after trail clothes so you&#8217;re welcome to bring as much warm clothes as you&#8217;d like.This is a &#8222;Book your own accommodation&#8220; event but our advice is this one:<br>https://maps.app.goo.gl/xfiXQDsrtcWGaSW9A<br>There will be a team gingerbread housing decoration contest for those staying at the hostel. Bring your own &#8222;materials&#8220; or use the one provided!We hope to see you there! On On!</td></tr><tr><td>Hare:</td><td>RainbowWarrior + CubanDicktaker</td></tr><tr><td>Date:</td><td>Friday 19th + Saturday 20th December 2025</td></tr><tr><td>Time:</td><td>13:00 (Saturday)</td></tr><tr><td>Venue:</td><td>Near A&amp;O hostel by the main train station</td></tr><tr><td>How to get there:</td><td>&#8211;</td></tr><tr><td>Google Maps:</td><td>https://maps.app.goo.gl/VLQ6JgER8Vctr1yq5</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>



<p></p>



<figure class="wp-block-table"><table><tbody><tr><td>Number:</td><td>NH3 Run #90 &#8211; Nocturnal&#8217;s Last Mission</td></tr><tr><td>Description:</td><td>The leaves have turned, the weather has changed, and one hasher is moving on. Nocturnal will finally hare a trail for us. Hopefully it doesn&#8217;t suck.<br>Trail is A to A.<br>A bag car will be available. Drinks and snacks at the end.<br>Bring €5 and a vessel. Review your hymnal and bring a song to share.<br>The trail is dog friendly.<br>On after will be at a restaurant near the run site.</td></tr><tr><td>Hare:</td><td>Nocturnal Mission</td></tr><tr><td>Date:</td><td>Saturday November 8th 2025</td></tr><tr><td>Time:</td><td>14:00</td></tr><tr><td>Venue:</td><td>S-Bahn station „Nürnberg-Mögeldorf“</td></tr><tr><td>How to get there:</td><td>From Nürnberg Hauptbahnhof, take the S2 or tram lines 5 or 11 in the direction of Tiergarten and get off at Nürnberg-Mögeldorf. You could also bike or walk &#8211; it&#8217;s less than 5km from the Hbf.<br>If you need to leave a bag in the bag car, please don&#8217;t be late. Bag car may be parked at the station or possibly closer to &#8222;A.&#8220;<br>If driving, you will most likely have to find street or shopping center parking, which are limited in this area. The train station has a parking lot, but it&#8217;s tiny.<br>Run site (start/end/&#8220;A&#8220;) will be a short walk (~200m) from the station. Follow chalk from the station to get there, or use the map link below.</td></tr><tr><td>Google Maps:</td><td>https://maps.app.goo.gl/H3QRRFU1uaiSZDnw5</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>



<figure class="wp-block-table"><table><tbody><tr><td>Number:</td><td>NH3 Run #89 &#8211; Spooky run</td></tr><tr><td>Description:</td><td>Beware! Run #89 will be the scariest of them all this year!<br>It will be a special Halloween Run, so come in costume<br>Location:<br>There will be a bag car for your stuff. Bring a change of clothes according to weather conditions and a chair. We&#8217;ll do a sitting circle at the end</td></tr><tr><td>Hare:</td><td>Cuban Dicktaker</td></tr><tr><td>Date:</td><td>Saturday October 11th 2025</td></tr><tr><td>Time:</td><td>14:00</td></tr><tr><td>Venue:</td><td>Parking Lot Norikerstraße (Nürnberg)</td></tr><tr><td>How to get there:</td><td>use technology</td></tr><tr><td>Google Maps:</td><td>https://maps.app.goo.gl/AMhCtihrHgqU4qpd9</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>



<figure class="wp-block-table"><table><tbody><tr><td>Number:</td><td>NH3 Run #88</td></tr><tr><td>Description:</td><td>Cum one, Cum all. TEAM WORK!!<br>Hung Like This is setting trail, which means that This will be Like the best trail This month. Hang out your best hash hear for This. Bring your cleanest hash vessel for This. Swot up on your favourite hash song for This. Most of all, remember that Jesus will not be there, as he is Hung Like This.</td></tr><tr><td>Hare:</td><td>Hung Like This</td></tr><tr><td>Date:</td><td>Saturday September 13th 2025</td></tr><tr><td>Time:</td><td>14:00</td></tr><tr><td>Venue:</td><td>P+R Parking Langwasser Süd (Nürnberg)</td></tr><tr><td>How to get there:</td><td>use technology</td></tr><tr><td>Google Maps:</td><td>https://maps.app.goo.gl/7una9qt2akZ7Tf2U7</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>



<figure class="wp-block-table"><table><tbody><tr><td>Number:</td><td>NH3 Run #87 – Warrior Trail, with sprinkles, a unicorn and a f**king Rainbow!</td></tr><tr><td>Description:</td><td>Come and feel the rainbow on the most bestial and colourful trail on the year!<br>Rainbow Warrior will lead us around the Nurnberg Zoo to find some fantastic beasts and amazing beers.<br>Trail is A to A.<br>A bag car will be available; beers, drinks and snacks provided at the end (bring 5€ and your own cup/vessel)<br>The trail is dog friendly and the walker&#8217;s trail is manageable with a troller (some shortcuts will be needed, ask the hare)</td></tr><tr><td>Hare:</td><td>Rainbow Warrior</td></tr><tr><td>Date:</td><td>Saturday August 9th 2025</td></tr><tr><td>Time:</td><td>14.00pm</td></tr><tr><td>Venue:</td><td>Tram station &#8222;Tiergarten&#8220; in Nürnberg</td></tr><tr><td>How to get there:</td><td>At the Nürnberg train station, take the tram line 5 or 11 in the direction of Tiergarten and get off at the last stop</td></tr><tr><td>Google Maps:</td><td>https://maps.app.goo.gl/XXpzeBkWQmYBELyt7</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>



<p></p>



<figure class="wp-block-table"><table><tbody><tr><td>Number:</td><td>Bayern Nash Hash</td></tr><tr><td>Description:</td><td>(Rego for hostel and Annafest is closed)<strong>Friday Night Drinks (PAYG)</strong><br>It&#8217;s called:&nbsp; &nbsp;Wiesen Biergarten<br>It&#8217;s located:&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/CVuNVVhvikgzNG6i9" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://maps.app.goo.gl/CVuNVVhvikgzNG6i9</a><br>From: 5pm<br>If you arrive earlier, then grab some tables&nbsp;<strong>Saturday Trail</strong><br>Time:&nbsp; 10am.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>Type: A to A Runner/Walkers<br>Shiggy level 2/10<br>Location:&nbsp; <strong>Willy Brandt Skulptur, Willy-Brandt-Platz, 90402 Nürnberg</strong> (short walk from the hostel)<br><a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/ysFeARguNgzvu5Rm9">https://maps.app.goo.gl/ysFeARguNgzvu5Rm9</a>Circle will be finished, latest, by 2pm. so you can go and change into your fest attire.<br>We need to be at the Hauptbahnhof by 3pm to get the train to the fest.<br>Your fest tickets will be handed out during circle.<strong>Annefast</strong><br>Time: Need to be there for 4pm, so will be leaving Nuremberg around 3pm.<br>More details on herding cats will be worked out later.<br>(No Dogs at the fest.&nbsp; unless you wanna pay €1,000 fine (you have been told).)<strong>Sunday Hangover Trail</strong><br>Time 11am<br>Type A to B Runners/Walkers<br>Location:&nbsp; <strong>Willy Brandt Skulptur, Willy-Brandt-Platz, 90402 Nürnberg</strong> (short walk from the hostel)<br><a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/ysFeARguNgzvu5Rm9">https://maps.app.goo.gl/ysFeARguNgzvu5Rm9</a>There is also a place for a swim<br>There should be a bag car to leave your circle gear in, but not your travelling gear, they stay in the bag room. You have to come back via the hostel to get to the train station anyway.<strong>Sunday Circle Close</strong><br>Let&#8217;s say 2ish/3ish. Could be earlier&#8230;&nbsp; but if you gotta leave to get a train/plane/laid or do something else, then no one is keeping you. I will not be bringing any rope. Unless requested.</td></tr><tr><td>Hare:</td><td>You&#8217;ll find out</td></tr><tr><td>Date:</td><td>July 25-27th 2025 (Friday-Sunday)</td></tr><tr><td>Time:</td><td>Be on it</td></tr><tr><td>Venue:</td><td>Nürnberg (check rego email and description above)</td></tr><tr><td>How to get there:</td><td>Use technology</td></tr><tr><td>Google Maps:</td><td>﻿</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>



