<figure class="wp-block-table"><table><tbody><tr><td>Number:</td><td>NH3 Run #80 &#8211; Bamberg Beer &amp; Walk Run</td></tr><tr><td>Description:</td><td>Join us for a fun-filled afternoon combining light exercise, scenic views, and refreshing beer!<br>What to Expect:<br>• Two Routes:<br>• Walkers: Enjoy a leisurely 5 km stroll through Bamberg’s picturesque streets.<br>• Runners: Opt for a relaxed 10–15 km jog, taking in the city’s historic sights.<br>• Two 15-Minute Breaks:<br>• First Stop: Gather at a historic landmark to rest and enjoy a cold beer.<br>• Second Stop: Visit a traditional local tavern to experience authentic Bamberg hospitality.<br>• Bring Your money for Spontaneous Drinks stops!<br>No need to be a seasoned runner or walker—everyone is welcome!</td></tr><tr><td>Hare:</td><td>BodyOfDesire</td></tr><tr><td>Date:</td><td>Sunday April 27th 2025</td></tr><tr><td>Time:</td><td>14.00pm</td></tr><tr><td>Venue:</td><td>Bamberg train station</td></tr><tr><td>How to get there:</td><td>Use technology (or public transportation)</td></tr><tr><td>Google Maps:</td><td>https://maps.app.goo.gl/LD73Gu27K5jvamGJ7?g_st=ac</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>



<figure class="wp-block-table"><table><tbody><tr><td>Number:</td><td>NH3 Run #79 &#8211; Neumarkt Run</td></tr><tr><td>Description:</td><td>Are you ready for a spring time adventure?<br>Come as your favorite woman and discover your female side &#8211; and the country side of Neumarkt!<br>Sounds like a boring town? Make it fancy and delight as with your dazzling presence and add a little pizzazz!<br>When: March 8th, 13:00<br>Where: Neumarkt (Oberpfalz) train station What it offers:<br>NO hash car &#8211; take only what you can carry, less is more 😉<br>Walkers trail + Runners trail &#8211; both not stroller friendly<br>If your doggo is fine with stairs, it should be fine on trail<br>Two beer stops &#8211; one is pay your own beer<br>Animal encounters: most likely<br>Shiggy level: barely<br>Mudd level: yesPlease let me know if you&#8217;re interested in an on after, so I can make reservations.I can&#8217;t promise it&#8217;ll bring you to climax but I promise the effort is there!Sounds like a bad deal? Happy international women&#8217;s Day to you, too!</td></tr><tr><td>Hare:</td><td>SqueezeIt</td></tr><tr><td>Date:</td><td>Saturday March 8th 2025</td></tr><tr><td>Time:</td><td>13.00pm</td></tr><tr><td>Venue:</td><td>Neumarkt (Oberpfalz) train station</td></tr><tr><td>How to get there:</td><td>Read the description</td></tr><tr><td>Google Maps:</td><td>https://maps.app.goo.gl/TxbFqRfFfBw8PTvDA</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>



<figure class="wp-block-table"><table><tbody><tr><td>Number:</td><td>NH3 Run #77 &#8211; Bad Santa run</td></tr><tr><td>Description:</td><td>Wankers!!!<br>Glühwein is so close, I can taste it!<br>Nuremberg H3&#8217;s first *Bad Santa/Red Dress* r*n is happening and a trifecta challenge has been issued for those brave enough! <br>The challenge is:<br>1. Visit Nuremberg Bad Santa/Red Dress run the weekend of November 29th-30th<br>2. Visit Frankfurt Hashmas the weekend of December 6th-8th<br>3. Visit Sembach 12 DownDowns the weekend of December 14th-15th<br>If you manage ALL three (3!) events, you will be awarded an amazing, unique, and truly helpful award item <br>Hare(s): Cuban DickTaker &amp; company<br>Shiggy level: frozen<br>29th November (PAYG): 1800! Pub Crawl / circle in comments!!! Trail is A to B (about 1km from each other)<br>30th November (€20): 1430! Circle at Cramer-Klett-Park, trail is A to A. We&#8217;ll stop at the Christmas market mid trail. Price covers one Glühwein at the market plus drinks at circle. Anything left (or adittional you&#8217;d like to donate) will go towards Toys for Tots.<br>Lies from the hare(s): bring cash, warm clothes, r*nning shoes, and your best Bad Santa attire! We&#8217;ll have Glühwein at the end of trail so bring your vessel.. leave your dignity at home <br>On On towards Bad Santa/Red Dress r*n </td></tr><tr><td>Hare:</td><td>Cuban Dicktaker</td></tr><tr><td>Date:</td><td>30.11.2024</td></tr><tr><td>Time:</td><td>15:00 / 3 p.m.</td></tr><tr><td>Venue:</td><td><div class="vk_sh vk_bk"><div class="desktop-title-content"><p class="DUwDvf lfPIob">Spielplatz &#8222;Cramer-Klett-Park&#8220;</p></div></div></td></tr><tr><td>How to get there:</td><td>Use your technological device.</td></tr><tr><td>Google Maps:</td><td><a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/cFUdLXwc3tGvwCH37">https://maps.app.goo.gl/vm7mWWkto796FEtL6</a></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>
